Ibrahim El Badawi
Local Guide · 300 reviews · 857 photos







2 years ago
Art Chinor offers a memorable dining experience in Tashkent. The highlight was their traditional Plov - a must-try for anyone visiting.

The restaurant's spacious layout combines beautiful interior design with historical elements, including a captivating drawing of Samarkand on the wall.

As a first-time visitor to Tashkent, this place made my introduction to Plov exceptional. Whether dining inside or outside, the atmosphere is inviting.

Highly recommended for anyone seeking a blend of culinary tradition and aesthetic charm.
